--- query
MATCH (a:person) WHERE a.age>20 WITH a ORDER BY a.ID SKIP 2 MATCH (a)-[e:knows]->(b:person) RETURN a.fName, b.fName ORDER BY b.fName LIMIT 2
--- expected
Carol|Alice
Carol|Bob
